  "steps": [
    "Pat the fish dry and mix the ginger garlic paste, chilli powder, coriander powder, turmeric, pepper, lemon juice and salt into a thick marinade.",
    "Coat the fish steaks well with the marinade and rest 20 minutes.",
    "Dust each steak lightly in the rice flour.",
    "Heat 2 tbsp of the oil on a tawa over medium heat.",
    "Shallow fry the steaks 3 to 4 minutes per side, adding oil as needed, until crisp and golden.",
    "Serve hot with onion rings and lemon wedges."
  ]
